      "name": "Famous Chollima",
      "aliases": [],
      "description": "FAMOUS CHOLLIMA is a CrowdStrike-tracked DPRK-nexus adversary associated with fraudulent remote IT-worker infiltration. CrowdStrike reports that the adversary uses AI-enhanced personas and front companies to obtain remote employment and generate revenue that is funneled to the North Korean regime.",
      "goals": [
        "CrowdStrike states that FAMOUS CHOLLIMA's IT-worker infiltration is primarily financially motivated and generates revenue for the North Korean regime."
      ],
